    {
      "text": "Spirit of God descending like a dove, Matt. 3:16. cast out devils by the Spirit of God, Matt. 12:28. led by the Spirit of God, they are the sons of God, Rom. 8:14. signs and wonders, by the power of the Spirit of God, Rom. 15:19. of God knoweth no man, but the Spirit of God, 1 Cor. 2:11. natural man receiveth not the things of the Spirit of God, 1 Cor. 2:14. ye are the temple of God … Spirit of God dwelleth in you, 1 Cor. 3:16. sanctified … justified … by the Spirit of our God, 1 Cor. 6:11. I think also that I have the Spirit of God, 1 Cor. 7:40. no man speaking by the Spirit of God calleth Jesus accursed, 1 Cor. 12:3. grieve not the holy Spirit of God, Eph. 4:30. Hereby know ye the Spirit of God, 1 Jn. 4:2.",
